sequenceDiagram
title Request Lifecycle Sequence Diagram

    participant Client
    participant Gateway
    participant Auth
    participant Chat
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant NATS
    participant RT as Realtime Service
    participant Redis
    participant Receiver

    Client->>Gateway: POST /messages

    Gateway->>Auth: Validate JWT
    Auth-->>Gateway: User Validated

    Gateway->>Chat: Forward Message

    Chat->>DB: Insert Message
    DB-->>Chat: Success

    Chat->>NATS: Emit chat.message.created

    NATS->>RT: Consume Event

    RT->>Redis: Fetch Active Connections

    RT->>Receiver: WebSocket Push